                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This was a great little game.\nIt looked good. The music was good.\nYou can choose the difficulty level and whether enemies are visible. You can customise your party with stat points\nthat suits your game play which made combat more interesting than the boring slog of some rpgmaker games.\n\nIf anything, It felt too short though, like a long chapter in a bigger story.\n",
